{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"863492177924980737","content":"\"Dear Sir, I hope this letter finds you in good health, We spoke days ago as you completed a small errand for me, and in our conversation you mentioned the desire to have a workshop to operate out of. I write to you now offering you that opportunity, to work a facility equipped with the finest tools and equipment. I have a project that requires a man of your talents, and I offer you the chance to prove yourself. Seek out Bo Harkness at your earliest convenience and inform him of your interest. Sincerely, Malathor\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T05:23:20.738000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868362698570735626","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
