{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"863492177924980737","content":"\"Heh, he has asked me of quite a few favors.\" He takes another sip. \"And each time he offered a reward. But I couldnt accept it, aint my thing to take money for such small tasks.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T05:39:03.644000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868366653405147217","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"863492177924980737","content":"\"He offers a great deal each time.\" Bo smiles. \"I just aint got the heart to accept it.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T05:39:37.441000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868366795160055848","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"863492177924980737","content":"\"I reckon if you're looking for paid work, he'll keep ya coinpurse full.\" He nods his head. \"He does seem to have quite the wealth.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T05:40:24.432000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868366992254595102","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"863492177924980737","content":"\"Ah yes I do recall!\" I brightly remember receiving your share of gold. \"I hope you do not think ill of me if I act quite the opposite.\" I say with a laugh. \"What I do tends to be quite expensive.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T05:40:49.026000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868367095409303563","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"863492177924980737","content":"\". . . and that *was* the last time I got paid.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T05:41:15.833000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868367207845998653","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"863492177924980737","content":"Bo chuckels. \"I dont mind at all my friend!\" He smiles. \"Master even offered to grant me my desire once...\" He finishes his goblet and slams it on the table in excitement.","created_at":"2021-07-24T05:42:43.873000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868367577112522784","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"863492177924980737","content":"\"As long as you pull your weight, I'm sure he can cure any money issues as well!\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T05:43:28.527000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868367764404961310","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"863492177924980737","content":"\"I intend to do all I can.\" I finish off my own goblet and then refill both, finishing the bottle - but putting it back into my coat.","created_at":"2021-07-24T05:45:42.330000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868368325615452220","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"863492177924980737","content":"From the other inside pocket I produce my horn. \"I have been practicing, but have had almost no opportunity to play with anyone since coming to empire city.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T05:46:59.227000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868368648144818187","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
